IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pt56-nouns`
IMPORT `pt56-cross-references`

-- Row il-56. The controls hold, and the recorded facts about the four defects are what NOTES.md says they are.
-- The defects themselves are NOT asserted sound anywhere in this file: their nine failing assertions are in pt56-tests-xrefs-red.l4.
-- Every expected value is written from the texts quoted in pt56-cross-references.l4, not from the output of the module.

§ `Tests of the sound controls`

-- I1: the footer lines name one day each, as do the two date pairs of the regulations on Kovetz HaTakanot 11193 and the routine's control date.
#ASSERT `the two dates on the line name one day` (`date line: the footer line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)
#ASSERT `the two dates on the line name one day` (`date line: the signature, KT 11193 p. 1886`)
#ASSERT `the two dates on the line name one day` (`date line: the footer, KT 11193 p. 1886`)
#ASSERT `the two dates on the line name one day` (`date line: the routine control date`)
#ASSERT `the days from the day by the routine to the Gregorian date printed` (`date line: the footer line, KT 11420 p. 3287`) EQUALS 0
-- I2: the sibling subsection's citation points at what it says, and its target is there.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: s 38לז(ג) to paragraph (7) of subsection (ב)`)
#ASSERT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: s 38לז(ג) to paragraph (7) of subsection (ב)`)
-- I3: the two citations inside the indexation clause point at what they say, and their targets are there.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: s 38נד to paragraphs (1) to (3) of the definition of qualifying expenses`)
#ASSERT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: s 38נד to paragraphs (1) to (3) of the definition of qualifying expenses`)
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: s 38נד to paragraphs (1) to (7) of subsection (ב) of s 38לז`)
#ASSERT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: s 38נד to paragraphs (1) to (7) of subsection (ב) of s 38לז`)
-- I4: the approval the instrument recites is the approval the power requires, and for the tax year 2025 the instrument was signed before the year began.
#ASSERT `the approving bodies agree` (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`) (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
#ASSERT `the instrument was signed before the tax year began` (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`) (`rate: tax year 2025, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)

§ `Tests of what the date lines record (I1)`

-- The signature line prints the day of the month 1 of Av 5784 and the Gregorian date 15 August 2024; the routine gives 5 August 2024 for 1 Av 5784, ten days earlier.
#ASSERT (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)'s `the Hebrew day of the month printed` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)'s `the Gregorian date printed` EQUALS (Date 15 8 2024)
#ASSERT (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)'s `the day the Hebrew date falls on, by the routine` EQUALS (Date 5 8 2024)
#ASSERT `the days from the day by the routine to the Gregorian date printed` (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`) EQUALS 10
#ASSERT NOT `the two dates on the line name one day` (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)
-- The footer of the same page, the control, prints 14 Av 5784 and 18 August 2024.
#ASSERT (`date line: the footer line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)'s `the Hebrew day of the month printed` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)'s `the printed words were read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the image or page is deposited`
#ASSERT (`date line: the signature line, KT 11420 p. 3287`)'s `the day by the routine was read from` EQUALS `the Hebrew-calendar routine, run after its control date`

§ `Tests of what the cross-references record (I2)`

-- The deeming names one bimonthly reporting method, and the chapter has none besides the deeming sentence itself, so the target has 0 of 1.
#ASSERT (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)'s `how many things the citing words name` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)'s `how many of them the target has` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT NOT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)
#ASSERT NOT `the target has everything the citing words name` (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)
-- Where each limb was read from: the target from a search of the official text layer, the citing words from the official page image (the page is not deposited).
#ASSERT (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `a search of the official text layer by the row builder, and the issue is not deposited`
#ASSERT (`reference: the deeming in s 38לז(ד) to a bimonthly reporting method`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the page is not deposited`

§ `Tests of what the indexation clause records (I3)`

#ASSERT NOT `the clause names an organ that publishes the updated amounts` (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)
#ASSERT (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)'s `the clause says which amounts a claim for damage before the first update day uses` EQUALS FALSE
-- The first update day is after the day the instrument that added the clause was published, so no update can come before it.
#ASSERT `the first update day is after the day the instrument was published` (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)
#ASSERT (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)'s `the day the instrument that added the clause was published` EQUALS (Date 4 5 2026)
#ASSERT (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)'s `the first update day after that` EQUALS (Date 1 1 2027)
#ASSERT (`clause: the annual update in s 38נד`)'s `the clause was read from` EQUALS `the official page, read from its image, and the image or page is deposited`

§ `Tests of what the power and the instrument record (I4)`

-- The power names a notice published in Reshumot; the instrument is regulations published in Kovetz HaTakanot; the statutory rate is on two bases and the instrument sets one figure for a tax year.
#ASSERT (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`)'s `the kind of instrument the power names` EQUALS `a notice published in Reshumot`
#ASSERT (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)'s `the kind of the instrument` EQUALS `regulations published in Kovetz HaTakanot`
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument is the kind of instrument the power names` (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`) (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
#ASSERT (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`)'s `how many bases the statutory rate is set on` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument sets one figure for each base the statutory rate is set on` (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`) (`rate: tax year 2024, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
-- The ordering of the signing day and the first day of the tax year 2024: the instrument was signed after the year began (the control, 2025, is above).
#ASSERT NOT `the instrument was signed before the tax year began` (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`) (`rate: tax year 2024, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)
#ASSERT (`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)'s `the day the instrument was signed` EQUALS (Date 6 3 2024)
#ASSERT (`rate: tax year 2024, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)'s `the percentage set` EQUALS 80
#ASSERT (`rate: tax year 2025, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886`)'s `the percentage set` EQUALS 100
#ASSERT (`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)`)'s `the power was read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
